  (text "Insert Coin secure chip: blank ATECC608B on the Cardputer Zero EXT header" (at 30.48 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid f7f2e9e2-021e-5f99-8337-20c99e0ed8c6))
  (text "EXT pins used: 4 GND, 6 5V OUT (switched by HAT_EN), 8 G2 SDA, 10 G3 SCL. Pin 2 (5V IN) is never connected." (at 30.48 35.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid e8e5dc67-6382-594c-8095-8b327efa89c6))
  (text "The I2C bus is 3.3 V and shared with the keyboard (0x34), gauge (0x55), codec (0x10), IO expander (0x4F), RTC." (at 30.48 40.64 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid a8563772-b268-5d58-bca6-5df36f530369))
  (text "A blank ATECC608B answers at 0x60. Its VCC must be 3.3 V so its pull-ups and logic levels match the Pi." (at 30.48 45.72 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 7eda887a-9bb9-5b2d-8ff6-5abfbe457d3f))
